# The context is the repository root, and the image needs the workspace's root files and the
# backend from it. Tests and their fixtures are not shipped.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!patches
!backend
backend/node_modules
backend/.file-storage
backend/**/*.md
backend/**/*_test.ts
backend/src/test
backend/open-api.json
backend/.spectral.yaml
